{"id":"msg_m_ex_hongryeon_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_hongryeon","label":"Scarlet · Nikke"},"label":"1. My Lord,","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_hongryeon_02","speakers":{"hongryeon":"Scarlet"},"icons":{"hongryeon":"si_c222_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_1","text":"My Lord,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_2","text":"are thou good at drinking?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_3","text":"I'm fond of drinking.","jump":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_5"},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_4","text":"I'm not a fan of drinking.","jump":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_7"},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_5","text":"Oh my...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_6","text":"That's the most beautiful thing that I've ever heard.","jump":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_10"},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_7","text":"Is that so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_8","text":"What a pity.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_9","text":"How so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_10","text":"When wandering on the surface,\nsplendid drinks come to me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_11","text":"But, the most pitiful thing is having no one to share them with.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_12","text":"An idea suddenly hit me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_13","text":"if thou know the joy of drinking, \nwe can share together.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_14","text":"If that's the case, I can have a drink with you anytime.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_15","text":"Wow!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_16","text":"Understood.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_17","text":"I shall join you in mine spare time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_18","text":"But, my Lord.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_19","text":"Dost thou have any alcohol stored at the house?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_20","text":"I have.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_21","text":"Wow, wow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_22","text":"I hath each moment been curious about what they taste like, those drinks from the Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_23","text":"It seems like I be about to have one.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_24","text":"When are you coming over?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_25","text":"I know not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_26","text":"So, expect not too much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_hongryeon_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_hongryeon_01_27","text":"I shall call thee later.","jump":null}],"chat":true}